<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Mysore Taipei 形象官網的最新消息文字編輯與 Moon Days Excel 上傳功能介紹。" />
    <title>Mysore Taipei｜形象官網案例</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="case-page">
      <a class="back-link" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/#work`}>← 返回案例</a>
      <header class="case-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">CASE 03 / MYSORE TAIPEI</p>
        <h1>Mysore Taipei</h1>
        <p class="intro">瑜伽學校的形象官網，介紹課程與學校資訊，並提供最新消息及 Moon Days 內容。</p>
        <ul class="tech" aria-label="功能"><li>形象官網</li><li>消息編輯</li><li>Excel 上傳</li></ul>
      </header>
      <section class="feature" aria-labelledby="news-title">
        <div class="feature-heading"><span class="feature-number">01 / NEWS</span><h2 id="news-title">最新消息管理</h2></div>
        <div class="feature-content"><p>後台提供文字編輯器，讓管理者編輯最新消息內容並呈現在官網。</p><a class="external-link" href="https://www.mysoretaipei.com/news" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看前台最新消息 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">（另開新視窗）</span></a></div>
      </section>
      <section class="feature" aria-labelledby="moondays-title">
        <div class="feature-heading"><span class="feature-number">02 / MOON DAYS</span><h2 id="moondays-title">Moon Days 資料上傳</h2></div>
        <div class="feature-content"><p>管理者可從後台上傳 Excel，管理官網的 Moon Days（月亮日）資料。</p><a class="external-link" href="https://www.mysoretaipei.com/moondays" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看前台月亮日 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">（另開新視窗）</span></a></div>
      </section>
      <footer class="case-footer"><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/#work`}>← 返回案例</a><a href="https://www.mysoretaipei.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 Mysore Taipei 官網 ↗<span class="sr-only">（另開新視窗）</span></a></footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; background: #f6f5ef; color: #223c33; font-family: Inter, 'Noto Sans TC', system-ui, sans-serif; }
  :global(a) { color: inherit; }
  :global(a:focus-visible) { outline: 3px solid #527134; outline-offset: 5px; }
  .case-page { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px clamp(22px, 5vw, 64px) 32px; }
  .back-link, .case-footer a { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 0; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none; }
  .case-intro { padding: clamp(68px, 10vw, 116px) 0 76px; border-bottom: 1px solid #cfd5cc; }
  .eyebrow, .feature-number { margin: 0 0 22px; color: #66756c; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .15em; }
  h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 68px); font-weight: 550; letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: 1.2; }
  .intro { max-width: 580px; margin-top: 24px; color: #627067; font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 20px); line-height: 1.9; }
  .tech { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 9px; margin: 30px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .tech li { padding: 7px 13px; border: 1px solid #c8d0c6; border-radius: 30px; font-size: 12px; }
  .feature { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: 48px; padding: 76px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #cfd5cc; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 38px); font-weight: 550; letter-spacing: -.04em; line-height: 1.3; }
  .feature-content > p { color: #56665d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.9; }
  .external-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 22px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 5px; }
  .steps { display: grid; gap: 0; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid #d5dad2; }
  .steps li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 34px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #d5dad2; }
  .step-number { padding-top: 3px; color: #718177; font-size: 12px; }
  h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 650; }
  .steps p { margin-top: 7px; color: #627067; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .case-footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; padding-top: 24px; color: #627067; font-size: 12px; }
  .sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .case-intro { padding: 64px 0 56px; } .feature { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 56px 0; } .feature-number { margin-bottom: 12px; } .case-footer { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; } }
</style>
